  "chip": "ESP32-P4",
  "notes": "Wired Ethernet (100M, PoE on the POE version), no Wi-Fi: it gets its address by DHCP and has no setup network. The VBUS pin is the board's 5 V rail and is live on PoE as well as USB. Drawn with USB at the bottom, so the network jack is at the top; that is upside down compared to Waveshare's pinout picture. There is no user LED, and the BOOT button doubles as an Ethernet pin, so there is no page button.",
